issue(id="0022" status="review")
  title Generate declarations only for the npm library entrypoint
  user-story
    as-a Package maintainer
    i-want Declaration generation limited to the public library entrypoint.
    so-that Executable and installation scripts do not produce unused type declarations.
  premise.
    The npm package exports src/index.ts as its library API. The bin and install
    entrypoints are scripts and still need JavaScript output, but no declarations.
  acceptance-criteria
    criterion The build emits index.js, bin.js, and install.js.
    criterion The build emits index.d.ts without bin.d.ts or install.d.ts.
    criterion Existing npm consumer tests and type checks pass.
  review-items
    item(status="covered") The public library export and runtime entrypoints retain their existing paths.
